  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the vine tomatoes, scotch bonnet peppers, onion, and garlic onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the thyme, allspice, and smoked paprika.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and sprinkle with the spice mixture.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve the skewers hot on a tagliere.",
    "Garnish with fresh thyme and scotch bonnet peppers.",
    "Enjoy your delicious Jazzy Smoky Jamaican Vine Tomatoes Skewers."
